<title>USA: Smithway to buy certain Marquardt assets.</title>
<headline>Smithway to buy certain Marquardt assets.</headline>
<dateline>FORT DODGE, Iowa 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smithway Motor Xpress Corp said Monday it signed an agreement to buy certain assets and assume the freight operations of Marquardt Transportation Inc of Yankton, S.D.</p>
<p>Marquardt Transportation generated about $14 million in revenue in 1995. Smithway said it will pay fair market value or assume existing financing for about 60 tractors and 100 trailers as well as miscellaneous other assets.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close by October 21.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
